---
layout: false
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
pagination:
  data: seiten
  size: 1
  alias: s
seiten:
  - slug: ""
    titel: "Startseite"
  - slug: "strategiekompass"
    titel: "Strategiekompass"
    kompass: "klar"
  - slug: "anwendungsfaelle"
    titel: "Anwendungsfälle"
    h1: 'Anwendungsfälle. <span class="hl">Aus dem Alltag.</span>'
    text: "Hier zeigen wir, wofür Versicherungsagenturen und Maklerbüros sofort sichtbar einsetzen: Neukunden gewinnen, Bestand aktivieren, Termine vor- und nachbereiten."
  - slug: "zielgruppenpakete"
    titel: "Zielgruppenpakete"
    h1: 'Zielgruppenpakete. <span class="hl">Fertig für dich.</span>'
    text: "Hier stehen alle 20 Zielgruppen mit Landingpage, Postings und Kundenmailings – zum Ansehen, Vergleichen und Auswählen."
  - slug: "dein-style"
    titel: "Dein Style"
    h1: 'Dein Style. <span class="hl">Dein Auftritt.</span>'
    text: "Hier zeigen wir, wie Logo, Farben, Bilder und Kontaktdaten in jedes Paket einfließen, damit alles nach deiner Agentur aussieht."
  - slug: "kontakt"
    titel: "Kontakt"
  - slug: "anspracheanlaesse"
    titel: "Anspracheanlässe"
  - slug: "marketing-as-a-service"
    titel: "Marketing as a Service"
  - slug: "maas-infografik"
    titel: "Infografik Marketing as a Service"
  - slug: "ueber-uns"
    titel: "Über uns"
    h1: 'Über uns. <span class="hl">Aus dem Vertrieb.</span>'
    text: "Hier stellen wir das Team hinter sofort sichtbar vor – und warum wir seit 2012 im Versicherungsvertrieb zu Hause sind."
permalink: "/entwicklung/storyboard/story6/{% if s.slug %}{{ s.slug }}/{% endif %}index.html"
---
{#- Storyboard 6: Startseite und vier Unterseiten (Dummys) im Grundstil des
    empiria-Repos (Seite „sofort sichtbar“ unter Marketing 2.0, Kopf wie
    empiria-Startseite ohne Logo-Laufband). Stylesheets, Schriften und Bilder
    1:1 aus dem empiria-Repo kopiert, liegen unter story6/assets/.
    Eigenständige Seiten (layout: false), alles in src/entwicklung/. -#}
{%- set A = "/entwicklung/storyboard/story6/assets" -%}
{%- set B = "/entwicklung/storyboard/story6" -%}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{% if s.slug %}{{ s.titel }} · {% endif %}Homepage-Story 6 – Entwicklung</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
<link rel="icon" href="/assets/img/logos/favicon.png" type="image/png">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ A }}/css/styles.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ A }}/css/e2.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ A }}/css/e2-seiten.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ A }}/css/e2-runde5.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ A }}/css/schwarzgelb-ergaenzung.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ A }}/css/sofort-sichtbar-seite.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ A }}/css/kontakt.css">
{% if s.kompass %}<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ A }}/kompass/kompass-g.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ A }}/kompass/kompass-cd.css">{% endif %}
<style>
/* Ergänzungen Story 6 – nur, was das Vorbild nicht mitbringt */
/* Entwicklungsmenü am Logo */
.s6-marke { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .35rem; flex: 0 0 auto; }
.s6-dd { position: relative; }
.s6-dd__auf { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 1.6rem; height: 1.6rem; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: none; color: #6f6a64; cursor: pointer; }
.s6-dd__auf:hover, .s6-dd__auf[aria-expanded="true"] { background: #f6f5f2; color: #1a1817; }
.s6-dd__auf svg { width: .7rem; height: .7rem; fill: currentColor; transition: transform .2s ease; }
.s6-dd__auf[aria-expanded="true"] svg { transform: rotate(180deg); }
.s6-dd__panel { position: absolute; top: calc(100% + .9rem); left: -6rem; z-index: 80; width: 21rem; max-height: calc(100vh - 140px); overflow-y: auto; padding: .7rem; border: 1px solid #e7e4df; border-radius: 16px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.12); }
.s6-dd__panel[hidden] { display: none; }
.s6-dd__hinweis { margin: 0 0 .5rem !important; padding: .7rem .8rem; border-radius: 10px; background: #fff400; color: #1a1817; font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.45; }
.s6-dd__gruppe { margin: .7rem .8rem .2rem !important; color: #6f6a64; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.s6-dd__panel a { display: block; padding: .5rem .8rem; border-radius: 8px; color: #1a1817; font-size: .9rem; text-decoration: none; }
.s6-dd__panel a:hover { background: #f6f5f2; }
.s6-dd__panel a[aria-current="page"] { font-weight: 600; background: #f6f5f2; }
/* Entwicklungsmenü-Ende */

.s6-dev { background: #1a1817; color: #cfcac3; font-size: 12.5px; }
.s6-dev .container { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: .3rem 1rem; padding-top: .45rem; padding-bottom: .45rem; }
.s6-dev b { color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
.s6-dev a { color: #fff400; text-decoration: none; }
.site-header .brand img { height: 2.5rem; width: auto; max-width: none; } /* wie .nav__logo auf sofortsichtbar.de */
.nav-links a[aria-current="page"] { font-weight: 600; }
.e2v-held__pfeil.s6-mockup { width: min(100%, 34rem) !important; }
.e2v-held__pfeil.s6-mockup img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
/* Einstieg Strategiekompass (Startseite): hell, Kicker · Headline · ein Satz · ein Knopf, rechts eine wortlose Vorschau im Look der Kompass-Seite */
.s6-kompass { padding: 6.5rem 0; background: #f6f5f2; }
.s6-kompass__raster { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
html body .e2-alt.e2-alt.e2-alt.e2-alt .s6-kompass h2 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.4vw, 3.6rem) !important; line-height: 1.22 !important; max-width: 17ch; }
html body.e2 main .s6-kompass__lead { margin-top: 1.4rem; max-width: 30rem; color: #3d3a37; font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.6; }
html body.e2 main .s6-kompass .e2-knopf { margin-top: 2rem; }
/* Vorschau: dieselben Bausteine wie auf der Kompass-Seite (Kachel mit schwarzem Rahmen, schwarze Strategie-Karte, gelber Knopf) – ohne Text */
.s6-vorschau { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1.2rem; padding: 1.6rem; border-radius: 22px; background: #fff; text-decoration: none; transition: transform .2s ease; }
.s6-vorschau:hover { transform: translateY(-4px); }
.s6-vorschau__links { display: grid; gap: .8rem; align-content: start; }
.s6-vorschau__frage { display: block; width: 70%; height: .9rem; border-radius: 99px; background: #1a1817; }
.s6-vorschau__frage--kurz { width: 55%; margin-top: .6rem; }
.s6-vorschau__kacheln { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: .5rem; }
.s6-vorschau__kacheln i { position: relative; display: block; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border: 1.5px solid #e7e4df; border-radius: 10px; }
.s6-vorschau__kacheln i.an { border: 2px solid #1a1817; }
.s6-vorschau__kacheln i.an::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: .4rem; right: .4rem; width: .8rem; height: .8rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #1a1817; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 .22rem #1a1817, inset 0 0 0 .4rem #fff400; }
.s6-vorschau__karte { display: grid; gap: .6rem; align-content: start; padding: 1.1rem; border-radius: 14px; background: #1a1817; }
.s6-vorschau__karte b { color: #fff; font: 700 1.05rem/1.2 "Lora", Georgia, serif; }
.s6-vorschau__zeile { display: block; height: .45rem; border-radius: 99px; background: #3d3a37; }
.s6-vorschau__zeile--kurz { width: 60%; }
.s6-vorschau__knopf { display: block; height: 1.6rem; margin-top: .6rem; border-radius: 99px; background: #fff400; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .s6-kompass__raster { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
/* Termin */
.s6-termin { padding: 6rem 0; background: #fff; }
.s6-termin__raster { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
.s6-termin h2 { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.4vw, 3.4rem); }
.s6-termin__text { margin-top: 1.2rem; max-width: 32rem; color: #3d3a37; font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.s6-termin__wege { display: grid; gap: .6rem; margin-top: 1.8rem; }
.s6-termin__wege a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; color: #1a1817; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; }
.s6-termin__wege svg { width: 1.3rem; height: 1.3rem; flex: none; }
.s6-termin__karte { padding: 2.4rem; border-radius: 18px; background: #1a1817; color: #fff; }
.s6-termin__karte h3 { color: #fff; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.1rem); }
.s6-termin__karte p { margin-top: 1rem; color: #cfcac3; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.s6-termin__karte .btn { margin-top: 1.8rem; }
/* Dummy-Unterseiten */
.s6-folgt { padding: 5rem 0 6rem; background: #fff400; }
.s6-folgt__kasten { padding: 2.4rem; border: 2px dashed #1a1817; border-radius: 18px; }
.s6-folgt h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem); }
.s6-folgt p { margin-top: .8rem; max-width: 40rem; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; }
html body.e2 .site-header .nav-links { gap: 1.6rem; position: static; transform: none; margin-left: auto; } /* empiria zentriert absolut – bei fünf Punkten läuft das in den Knopf */
html body.e2 .site-header .nav-cta { margin-left: 2rem !important; }
html body.e2 .site-header .nav-links a { white-space: nowrap; font-size: .9rem; }
/* Fünf Menüpunkte plus Knopf: Burger-Menü schon ab 1200px statt 900px */
@media (max-width: 1200px) {
  html body.e2 .site-header .nav-links, html body.e2 .site-header .nav-cta { display: none; }
  html body.e2 .site-header .nav-toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 44px; height: 44px; border: 0; background: none; color: var(--ink); margin-left: auto; }
  html body.e2 .site-header .nav { height: 68px; }
  html body.e2 .mobile-menu { position: fixed; inset: 68px 0 auto 0; z-index: 55; background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #ededed; display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 12px var(--pad-x, 20px) 24px; box-shadow: 0 12px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.06); transform: translateY(-120%); transition: transform .3s ease; }
  html body.e2 .mobile-menu.open { transform: none; }
  html body.e2 .mobile-menu a { padding: 14px 0; font-size: 1.15rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #f2f2f2; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }
}
.mobile-menu:not(.open) { visibility: hidden; }
@media (max-width: 960px) {
  html body.e2 .e2v-held__raster .e2v-held__pfeil.s6-mockup { position: static !important; grid-column: 1 !important; grid-row: auto !important; order: 3 !important; width: 100% !important; max-width: 26rem; margin: 2rem 0 0 !important; justify-self: start !important; }
  html body.e2 .e2v-held__text-oben h1 { padding-right: 0 !important; }
}
/* Kontakt-Abschnitt und Kontaktseite */
html body.e2 .s6-ks .kontakt-standalone-text :is(h1, h2) { font-size: clamp(3rem, 7.2vw, 6.2rem) !important; line-height: 1.22 !important; }
html body.e2 .s6-ks .kontakt-standalone-text .lead { margin-top: 1.8rem !important; }
html body.e2 .s6-ks .kontakt-standalone-side { margin-top: 6.49rem; }
.s6-ks__label { font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f6a64; }
html body.e2 main .s6-ks__themen { margin: 1rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
.s6-ks__themen li { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; padding: 1rem 0; border-top: 1px solid #e7e4df; color: #1a1817; font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; }
.s6-ks__themen li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e4df; }
.s6-ks__themen svg { width: 1.8rem; height: 1.8rem; flex: none; color: #1a1817; } /* Symbole ohne Kachel (Gestaltungsregel) */
html body.e2 main .s6-ks__knopf { margin-top: 1.8rem; align-self: flex-start; }
.s6-ks__zeichen { width: clamp(320px, 42vw, 640px) !important; bottom: 12% !important; color: rgba(26,24,23,.08) !important; }
.s6-kalender { margin-bottom: clamp(40px, 6vw, 80px); min-height: 600px; }
html body.e2 .s6-ks--seite .kontakt-standalone-side { margin-top: 6.49rem; }
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  html body.e2 .s6-ks .kontakt-standalone-side { margin-top: 1.6rem; }
}
/* Anspracheanlässe (intern) */
.aa__liste > li { padding-bottom: 1rem; }
.aa__liste > li > a { padding-bottom: .4rem; }
html body.e2 main .aa__anlaesse { margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0 1rem; list-style: none; border-left: 3px solid #fff400; }
.aa__anlaesse li { border: 0 !important; padding: .15rem 0; color: #3d3a37; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.45; }
.aa__anlaesse li.aa__leer { color: #9b958e; font-style: italic; }
html body.e2 main .aa__quelle { margin-top: 3rem; color: #6f6a64; font-size: .85rem; }

/* ===== Marketing as a Service (intern) – Maßstab Volksfest-Seite, empiria-CD =====
   Schriften: Lora 600/700 nur für Überschriften und Kartentitel, Poppins für alles andere.
   Farben: Tinte #1a1817, Grau #6f6a64, Gelb nur als Fläche, Häkchen auf Schwarz und Icons auf Schwarz.
   Gleichartige Karten: gemeinsames Raster (subgrid) – Titel, Preise, Linien und Knöpfe auf gleicher Höhe. */
.maas .container { max-width: 76rem; }
html body .e2-alt.maas h2 { text-wrap: balance; max-width: 30ch; font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.2vw, 3.4rem) !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-lead { margin-top: 1.2rem !important; max-width: 44rem; font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.62; color: #3d3a37; }
.mx-band { padding: 6rem 0; background: #fff; }
.mx-band--gelb { background: #fff400; }
.mx-band--hell { background: #f4f3f0; }
.mx-band--schwarz { background: #1a1817; color: #fff; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-band--schwarz h2 { color: #fff; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-band--schwarz .kicker { color: #fff400; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-band--schwarz .mx-lead { color: #cfcac3; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-notiz { margin-top: 1.4rem !important; font-size: .85rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #6f6a64; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-band--schwarz .mx-notiz { color: #9b958e; }
.mx-mehr { margin-top: auto; align-self: flex-start; padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; cursor: pointer; font: 600 .9rem/1 var(--font-sans, Poppins, sans-serif); color: #1a1817; }
.mx-mehr:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.mx-band--schwarz .mx-mehr { color: #fff400; }
.mx-band--schwarz .maas-d .mx-mehr { color: #1a1817; }

/* 1 · Kopf */
.mx-held { padding: 5rem 0 5.5rem; background: #fff; }
.mx-held__raster { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr); gap: 4rem; align-items: center; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-held h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6.4vw, 5.4rem) !important; line-height: 1.34 !important; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-held .hl { white-space: nowrap; }
.mx-held__knoepfe { margin-top: 2rem; }
.mx-fakten { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, auto); justify-content: start; gap: 2.8rem; margin: 2.6rem 0 0; padding-top: 1.6rem; border-top: 1px solid #e7e4df; }
.mx-fakten dt { font: 700 1.5rem/1.1 var(--font-sans, Poppins, sans-serif); color: #1a1817; }
.mx-fakten dd { margin: .35rem 0 0; font-size: .88rem; color: #6f6a64; }
.mx-held__bild img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }

/* Der Weg (hellgrau): Phasen als Blöcke, Zeilen im festen Raster Nr · Frage · Wir · Du; Verkaufen schwarz; Übergabe gelb */
.mx-weg { margin-top: 3rem; }
.mx-weg__kopf, .mx-weg__schritt { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2.6rem minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1.6fr) minmax(0, 1fr); column-gap: 2rem; }
.mx-weg__kopf { padding: 0 2rem .8rem; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f6a64; }
.mx-weg__block { padding: .6rem 2rem; border-radius: 22px; background: #fff; }
.mx-weg__block + .mx-weg__block { margin-top: 1rem; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__phase { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: .8rem; margin: 1.1rem 0 .4rem !important; }
.mx-weg__phase b { font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1a1817; }
.mx-weg__phase span { font-size: .85rem; color: #6f6a64; }
.mx-weg__schritt { align-items: start; padding: 1.2rem 0; border-top: 1px solid #ece9e5; }
.mx-weg__nr { display: grid; place-items: center; width: 2.2rem; height: 2.2rem; border: 2px solid #1a1817; border-radius: 50%; font: 600 .9rem/1 var(--font-sans, Poppins, sans-serif); color: #1a1817; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__schritt h3 { margin: .25rem 0 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.3; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__wir, html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__du { margin: .3rem 0 0 !important; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #3d3a37; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__du { color: #1a1817; font-weight: 500; }
.mx-weg__mobil { display: none; }
.mx-weg__block--dunkel { background: #1a1817; }
.mx-weg__block--dunkel .mx-weg__phase b { color: #fff400; }
.mx-weg__block--dunkel .mx-weg__phase span { color: #cfcac3; }
.mx-weg__block--dunkel .mx-weg__schritt { border-top-color: rgba(255,255,255,.14); }
.mx-weg__block--dunkel .mx-weg__nr { border-color: #fff400; color: #fff400; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__block--dunkel h3 { color: #fff; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__block--dunkel .mx-weg__wir { color: #cfcac3; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__block--dunkel .mx-weg__du { color: #fff; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__uebergabe { text-wrap: pretty; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 1rem; margin: 1rem 0 !important; padding: 1.1rem 2rem; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff400; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #1a1817; }
.mx-weg__uebergabe b { flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__fuss { margin-top: 1.6rem !important; }
.mx-weg__fuss a { display: inline; text-wrap: pretty; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1817; text-decoration: none; }
.mx-weg__fuss a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.mx-weg__fuss .e2-pfeil { display: inline-block; vertical-align: -.2em; margin-left: .3rem; width: 1.1rem; height: 1.1rem; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2; }
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .mx-weg__kopf { display: none; }
  .mx-weg__schritt { grid-template-columns: 2.6rem minmax(0, 1fr); row-gap: .2rem; }
  .mx-weg__schritt > p { grid-column: 2; }
  .mx-weg__block { padding: .4rem 1.4rem; }
  .mx-weg__mobil { display: block; margin-top: .5rem; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f6a64; }
  .mx-weg__block--dunkel .mx-weg__mobil { color: #9b958e; }
  html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__du:empty { display: none; }
  html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-weg__uebergabe { flex-direction: column; gap: .3rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem; }
}

/* Vier Stufen (erste Ebene): Stufe 1 gelb = unser Schwerpunkt, Stufen 2–4 weiß; Klammern darüber; gemeinsames Raster */
.mx-stufen { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-template-rows: auto repeat(5, auto); column-gap: 1.2rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-stufen__klammer { grid-row: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; margin: 0 0 1.1rem !important; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f6a64; }
.mx-stufen__klammer::after { content: ""; flex: 1; height: 2px; background: #cfcac3; }
.mx-stufen__klammer--wir { grid-column: 1; color: #1a1817 !important; }
.mx-stufen__klammer--wir::after { background: #1a1817; }
.mx-stufen__klammer:not(.mx-stufen__klammer--wir) { grid-column: 2 / span 3; }
.mx-stufe { position: relative; display: grid; grid-row: 2 / span 5; grid-template-rows: subgrid; row-gap: 0; padding: 1.7rem 1.6rem 1.6rem; border-radius: 22px; background: #fff; }
.mx-stufe--wir { background: #fff400; }
.mx-stufe:not(:last-child)::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 2.1rem; right: -1.05rem; z-index: 1; width: .9rem; height: .9rem; border-top: 2px solid #1a1817; border-right: 2px solid #1a1817; transform: rotate(45deg); }
.mx-stufe__kopf { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1a1817; }
.mx-stufe__ico { width: 1.9rem; height: 1.9rem; color: #1a1817; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-stufe > h3 { margin: 1.2rem 0 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.2; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-stufe__text { margin: .6rem 0 0 !important; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #3d3a37; }
.mx-stufe--wir .mx-stufe__text { color: #1a1817 !important; }
.mx-stufe__extra { margin-top: 1rem; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-stufe__label { margin: 0 0 .5rem !important; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f6a64; }
.mx-stufe--wir .mx-stufe__label { color: #1a1817 !important; }
.mx-stufe__bs a { color: #1a1817; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
.mx-stufe__bs a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.mx-stufe__wege { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: .4rem; }
.mx-stufe__wege li { position: relative; padding-left: 1.5rem; font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.45; color: #1a1817; }
.mx-stufe__wege li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: .1rem; top: .38rem; width: .7rem; height: .36rem; border-left: 2px solid #1a1817; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1817; transform: rotate(-45deg); }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-stufe__ergebnis { align-self: start; margin: 1.4rem 0 0 !important; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #ece9e5; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; color: #1a1817; }
.mx-stufe--wir .mx-stufe__ergebnis { border-top-color: rgba(26,24,23,.25); }
.mx-stufe__ergebnis span { display: block; margin-bottom: .25rem; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #6f6a64; }
.mx-stufe--wir .mx-stufe__ergebnis span { color: #1a1817; }
.mx-fundament { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem 3rem; margin-top: 1.2rem; padding: 1.8rem 2rem; border-radius: 22px; background: #1a1817; color: #fff; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-fundament__label { margin: 0 0 .4rem !important; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff400; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-fundament__text { margin: 0 !important; max-width: 46rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #cfcac3; }
.mx-fundament__knopf { flex: 0 0 auto; padding: .95rem 1.5rem; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff400; color: #1a1817; font: 600 .95rem/1 var(--font-sans, Poppins, sans-serif); cursor: pointer; }
.mx-fundament__knopf:hover { background: #fff; }
/* Fenster mit den sechs Fragen: breiter, Blöcke auf Weiß grau hinterlegt */
.maas-d--weit { width: min(66rem, calc(100vw - 2rem)); }
.maas-d--weit .mx-weg { margin-top: 1.6rem; }
.maas-d--weit .mx-weg__block:not(.mx-weg__block--dunkel) { background: #f4f3f0; }
html body .maas-d .mx-weg__schritt h3 { margin: .25rem 0 0 !important; font-size: 1.15rem !important; }
html body .maas-d .mx-weg__wir, html body .maas-d .mx-weg__du { margin: .3rem 0 0 !important; font-size: .92rem !important; line-height: 1.55 !important; }
html body .maas-d .mx-weg__block--dunkel .mx-weg__schritt h3 { color: #fff !important; }
html body .maas-d .mx-weg__block--dunkel .mx-weg__wir { color: #cfcac3 !important; }
html body .maas-d .mx-weg__block--dunkel .mx-weg__du { color: #fff !important; }
html body .maas-d .mx-weg__phase, html body .maas-d .mx-weg__uebergabe { margin-bottom: .4rem !important; }
html body .maas-d .mx-weg__uebergabe { margin: 1rem 0 !important; color: #1a1817 !important; }
@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .mx-stufen { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-template-rows: none; row-gap: 1.2rem; }
  html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-stufen__klammer { display: none; }
  .mx-stufe { grid-row: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .mx-stufe__extra { flex: 1; }
  html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-stufe__ergebnis { align-self: stretch; }
  .mx-stufe::after { display: none; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .mx-stufen { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .mx-fundament { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; padding: 1.6rem 1.5rem; }
}

/* Strukturbild (erste Ebene): weißer Rahmen auf Hellgrau, auf schmalen Bildschirmen seitlich wischbar */
.mx-bild { margin: 3rem 0 0; }
.mx-bild__rahmen { padding: 2.4rem 2.6rem 2rem; border-radius: 22px; background: #fff; overflow-x: auto; }
.mx-bild__rahmen svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; min-width: 52rem; }
.mx-bild__fuss { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .6rem 1.6rem; margin-top: 1rem; font-size: .85rem; color: #6f6a64; }
.mx-bild__leg { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .5rem; }
.mx-bild__leg::before { content: ""; width: .9rem; height: .9rem; border-radius: 4px; border: 1.5px solid #1a1817; background: #fff; }
.mx-bild__leg--wir::before { background: #fff400; border-color: #fff400; }
.mx-bild__wisch { display: none; }
.mx-bild__dl { margin-left: auto; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1817; text-decoration: none; }
.mx-bild__detail { padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; cursor: pointer; font: 600 .85rem/1.4 var(--font-sans, Poppins, sans-serif); color: #1a1817; }
.mx-bild__detail:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.mx-detail { margin-top: 1.4rem; overflow-x: auto; }
.mx-detail svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; min-width: 52rem; }
.maas-d__hinweis a { color: #1a1817; font-weight: 600; }
.mx-detail__fuss { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .5rem 1.6rem; }
.mx-detail__fuss a:first-of-type { margin-left: auto; }
.mx-bild__dl:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
@media (max-width: 900px) { .mx-bild__rahmen { padding: 1.6rem; } .mx-bild__wisch { display: inline; } .mx-bild__dl { margin-left: 0; } }

/* 2 · So arbeiten wir (gelb): nummerierte Schritte mit gestrichelter Linie wie auf der Volksfest-Seite */
.mx-ablauf { list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 2.4rem; margin: 3rem 0 0; padding: 0; position: relative; }
.mx-ablauf li:not(:last-child)::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: 1.2rem; left: 2.9rem; right: -1.9rem; border-top: 2px dashed rgba(26,24,23,.45); }
.mx-ablauf li { position: relative; }
.mx-ablauf__nr { position: relative; display: grid; place-items: center; width: 2.4rem; height: 2.4rem; border: 2px solid #1a1817; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff400; font: 600 .95rem/1 var(--font-sans, Poppins, sans-serif); }
.mx-ablauf__ico { display: block; width: 2rem; height: 2rem; margin-top: 1.6rem; color: #1a1817; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-ablauf h3 { margin: .9rem 0 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.35rem; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-ablauf p { margin: .5rem 0 0 !important; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #1a1817; }

/* 3 · Bausteine */
.mx-preis { margin: 0 !important; font-size: .95rem; color: #6f6a64; }
.mx-preis b { font: 700 2rem/1.1 var(--font-sans, Poppins, sans-serif); color: #1a1817; margin-right: .3rem; }
.mx-kern { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6fr) minmax(0, 5fr); margin-top: 3rem; border-radius: 22px; background: #1a1817; color: #fff; overflow: hidden; }
.mx-kern__links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; padding: 2.6rem 2.6rem 2.4rem; }
.mx-kern__kopf, .mx-karte__kopf { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.mx-kern__kopf { color: #fff400; }
.mx-kern__ico { width: 1.8rem; height: 1.8rem; color: #fff400; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-kern__links > h3 { margin: 1.6rem 0 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.6vw, 3rem); line-height: 1.1; color: #fff; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-kern__links > .mx-preis { margin-top: 1rem !important; color: #cfcac3; }
.mx-kern .mx-preis b { color: #fff; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-kern__kurz { margin: 1.4rem 0 2rem !important; max-width: 30rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: #cfcac3; }
.mx-kern .mx-mehr { color: #fff400; }
.mx-kern__rechts { padding: 2.6rem 2.6rem 2.4rem; border-left: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-label { margin: 0 0 1rem !important; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9b958e; }
.mx-haken { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
.mx-haken li { position: relative; padding: .85rem 0 .85rem 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #fff; }
.mx-haken li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
.mx-haken li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: .1rem; top: 1.05rem; width: .8rem; height: .42rem; border-left: 2px solid #fff400; border-bottom: 2px solid #fff400; transform: rotate(-45deg); }
.mx-erg { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-template-rows: repeat(7, auto); column-gap: 1.4rem; margin-top: 1.4rem; }
.mx-karte { display: grid; grid-row: span 7; grid-template-rows: subgrid; row-gap: 0; padding: 2rem 2rem 1.8rem; border: 1px solid #e4e0db; border-radius: 22px; background: #fff; }
.mx-karte__kopf { color: #1a1817; }
.mx-karte__ico { width: 1.6rem; height: 1.6rem; color: #1a1817; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-karte > h3 { margin: 1.4rem 0 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.2; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-karte > .mx-preis { margin-top: .8rem !important; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-karte__zusatz { margin: .3rem 0 0 !important; min-height: 1.4em; font-size: .88rem; color: #1a1817; font-weight: 500; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-karte__kurz { margin: 1.2rem 0 0 !important; padding-top: 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid #ece9e5; font-size: .95rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #3d3a37; }
.mx-punkte { list-style: none; margin: 1rem 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: .45rem; align-content: start; }
.mx-punkte li { position: relative; padding-left: 1.6rem; font-size: .92rem; line-height: 1.45; color: #1a1817; }
.mx-punkte li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: .1rem; top: .38rem; width: .7rem; height: .36rem; border-left: 2px solid #1a1817; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1817; transform: rotate(-45deg); }
.mx-karte .mx-mehr { margin-top: 1.6rem; align-self: end; justify-self: start; text-align: left; }

/* 4 · Team (schwarz): Klammer über vier Karten im Kernpaket, eine mit Paid Ads; dunkle Karten mit gelben Icons */
.mx-team { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-template-rows: auto repeat(5, auto); column-gap: 1.2rem; margin-top: 3rem; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-team__klammer { grid-row: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; margin: 0 0 1.2rem !important; font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #cfcac3; }
.mx-team__klammer::after { content: ""; flex: 1; height: 2px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.3); }
.mx-team__klammer--kern { grid-column: 1 / span 4; color: #fff400 !important; }
.mx-team__klammer--kern::after { background: #fff400; }
.mx-profil { display: grid; grid-row: 2 / span 5; grid-template-rows: subgrid; row-gap: 0; padding: 1.8rem 1.6rem 1.6rem; border-radius: 18px; background: #262321; }
.mx-profil__ico { width: 2.2rem; height: 2.2rem; color: #fff400; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-profil > .mx-profil__stelle { margin: .45rem 0 0 !important; padding-bottom: .9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14); font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.45; color: #fff; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-profil > h3 { margin: 1.3rem 0 0; font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.3rem; line-height: 1.2; color: #fff; hyphens: manual; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-profil > p { margin: .7rem 0 0 !important; font-size: .92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cfcac3; }
.mx-profil .mx-mehr { margin-top: 1.4rem; align-self: end; justify-self: start; text-align: left; }
.mx-immer { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .8rem 2.2rem; margin-top: 2.4rem; padding: 1.2rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 14px; background: #fff400; color: #1a1817; }
.mx-immer span { font-size: .74rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.mx-immer b { position: relative; padding-left: 1.5rem; font-size: .98rem; font-weight: 600; }
.mx-immer b::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: .1rem; top: .38rem; width: .7rem; height: .36rem; border-left: 2px solid #1a1817; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1817; transform: rotate(-45deg); }

/* 5 · Download */
.mx-band--hell .pdf-dl { margin: 0; }

/* Fenster: hell und ruhig – Titel Lora, Inhalt Poppins in zwei Größen, Label grau, Blöcke mit feiner Linie */
html body .maas-d p { margin: 0 0 .8rem !important; font-size: 1rem !important; line-height: 1.65 !important; color: #3d3a37 !important; }
html body .maas-d h3 { margin: 0 2.5rem 1.4rem 0 !important; font-family: var(--font-serif) !important; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.1rem) !important; line-height: 1.2 !important; color: #1a1817 !important; }
html body .maas-d .maas-d__stelle { margin: -.8rem 0 1.4rem !important; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1817 !important; }
.maas-d { max-height: calc(100dvh - 2rem); overflow-y: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; } /* langes Fenster scrollt in sich */
.maas-d .e2-dialog__zu:focus { outline: none; } /* kein Auswahlring beim Öffnen */
html body .maas-d .maas-d__meta, html body .maas-d .maas-d__label { margin: 0 0 .5rem !important; font-size: .85rem !important; font-weight: 500; color: #6f6a64 !important; }
html body .maas-d .maas-d__label { margin-top: 1.6rem !important; }
.maas-d__liste > div { padding: .9rem 0; border-top: 1px solid #e7e4df; }
.maas-d__liste b { display: block; font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1a1817; }
html body .maas-d .maas-d__liste p { margin: .25rem 0 0 !important; }
.maas-d__liste ul, .maas-d__ul { list-style: none; margin: .4rem 0 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: .3rem; }
.maas-d__ul { padding-top: .7rem; border-top: 1px solid #e7e4df; }
.maas-d__liste li, .maas-d__ul li { position: relative; padding-left: 1.1rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #3d3a37; }
.maas-d__liste li::before, .maas-d__ul li::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; top: .62rem; width: .35rem; height: .35rem; border-radius: 50%; background: #1a1817; }
html body .maas-d .maas-d__hinweis { margin: 1rem 0 0 !important; padding-top: .9rem; border-top: 1px solid #e7e4df; font-size: .85rem !important; color: #6f6a64 !important; }

@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .mx-team { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); grid-template-rows: none; row-gap: 1.2rem; }
  html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-team__klammer { display: none; }
  .mx-profil { grid-row: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .mx-profil .mx-mehr { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 1.4rem; align-self: flex-start; }
  .mx-ablauf { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); row-gap: 3rem; }
  .mx-ablauf li::after { display: none; }
}
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .mx-held__raster, .mx-kern { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .mx-held__bild { max-width: 26rem; }
  .mx-kern__rechts { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
  .mx-erg { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-rows: none; row-gap: 1.4rem; }
  .mx-karte { grid-row: auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  html body .e2-alt.maas .mx-karte__zusatz:empty { display: none; }
  .mx-karte .mx-mehr { align-self: flex-start; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .mx-band { padding: 4.5rem 0; }
  .mx-held { padding: 3rem 0 4rem; }
  .mx-ablauf, .mx-team { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  .mx-fakten { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1.2rem; }
  .mx-fakten dt { font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .mx-kern__links, .mx-kern__rechts, .mx-karte { padding: 1.8rem 1.5rem; }
  .mx-immer { padding: 1.2rem 1.4rem; }
}

/* Infografik-Entwürfe */
.ig-entwurf { padding: 5rem 0; background: #fff; }
.ig-entwurf--hell { background: #f4f3f0; }
html body .e2-alt.maas .ig-entwurf h2 { margin-top: 0; }
.ig-bild { margin-top: 2.4rem; border: 1px solid #e4e0db; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(26,24,23,.08); }
.ig-bild svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
.ig-bild--b, .ig-bild--rollup { max-width: 44rem; }
.ig-bild--rollup { max-width: 30rem; }
.ig-dl { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .6rem 1.6rem; margin-top: 1.2rem !important; font-size: .9rem; }
.ig-dl a { font-weight: 600; color: #1a1817; text-decoration: none; }
.ig-dl a:first-child { padding: .55rem 1rem; border-radius: 999px; background: #1a1817; color: #fff; }
.ig-dl a:not(:first-child):hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.ig-dl { align-items: center; }

/* Zielgruppenpakete: Verzeichnis in zwei Spalten. Je Ebene eine Schrift, zwei Größen, zwei Farben. */
.zp-kopf { padding-bottom: 3.5rem !important; }
html body.e2 .zp-kopf h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 8.4vw, 6rem) !important; line-height: 1.12 !important; }
html body.e2 main .zp-kopf__lead { margin-top: 2.2rem; max-width: 52rem; color: #3d3a37; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; }
.zp { padding: 1rem 0 7rem; background: #fff; }
.zp__spalten { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 3rem clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
.zp__spalte h2 { padding-bottom: 1.2rem; border-bottom: 3px solid #1a1817; font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); }
html body.e2 main .zp__liste { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
.zp__liste li { border-bottom: 1px solid #e7e4df; }
.zp__liste a { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding: 1.15rem 0; color: #1a1817; text-decoration: none; }
.zp__liste span { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.3; padding: 0 .1em; background: linear-gradient(transparent 62%, transparent 62%); transition: background .15s ease; }
.zp__liste a:hover span, .zp__liste a:focus-visible span { background: linear-gradient(transparent 58%, #fff400 58%, #fff400 92%, transparent 92%); }
.zp__liste svg { width: 1.3rem; height: 1.3rem; flex: none; fill: none; stroke: #1a1817; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; transition: transform .15s ease; }
.zp__liste a:hover svg { transform: translateX(4px); }
.zp-band { padding: 5rem 0; background: #1a1817; color: #fff; }
.zp-band__in { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem 2rem; }
html body.e2 .zp-band h2 { color: #fff; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); }
.zp-band__knopf { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; padding: 1.1rem 1.8rem; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff400; color: #1a1817; font: 600 1.05rem/1 "Poppins", sans-serif; text-decoration: none; }
.zp-band__knopf svg { width: 1.3rem; height: 1.3rem; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 2; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
@media (max-width: 760px) { .zp__spalten { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } .zp__liste span { font-size: 1.1rem; } }
/* .e2 main p setzt margin:0 – Abstände daher mit höherer Spezifität */
html body.e2 main .s6-termin__text { margin-top: 1.2rem; }
html body.e2 main .s6-termin__karte p { margin-top: 1rem; }
html body.e2 main .s6-termin__karte .e2-knopf { margin-top: 1.8rem; }
